nt></p></center></td>\n<td width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Two-Hand Damage: 6-21 (13.5 \nAvg)<br>Required Level: 28<br>Required Strength: 18<br>Durability: 20<br>Base \nWeapon Speed: [-10] <br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150% Damage To \nUndead</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+1 To All Skill Levels</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30% Faster Cast Rate</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Magic Damage \nReduced By 15</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">All Resistances +50</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+175 To Mana</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+80 To \nLife</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Attacker Takes Damage Of 15</font><br>(Only \nSpawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">양손 \n                            데미지 : 6-21 (13.5 \nAvg)<br>레벨 요구치 l: 28<br>힘 요구치 : 18<br>내구력 : 20<br>무기기본속도 : [-10] <br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150% 데몬계열에 대해 데미지 증가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+1 모든 스킬</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30% 매우 빠른 캐스팅 속도</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">매직데미지 감소 15</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">모든 저항력 +50</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+175 마나</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+80 라이프</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">공격자가 받는 데미지 15</font><br>(Only \nSpawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img data-original-src=\"http://forg.uospace.net:80/Diablo/images/item/unique/ribcracker.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"118\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:62/118\" width=\"62\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; m